msgstr "制作一个安装飞控的平台，在四个角处打孔或安装螺丝。用双面泡棉胶带将飞控固定在此板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:107
#: 2939b81b047146d9882af768d4e1a22c 9d1ab1a6bac24273a83a8171cd9c0a01
#: c7635b2726a7413da1afac8d603be22f cc86c1ca5ce2429b9f4e10e219357ada
#: e1cc657a567e46538299704791348402
msgid ""
"Mount 4 standoffs on the top of your frame spaced 1/10\" to 1/8\" further "
"apart than the width of the platform upon which the control board has been "
"mounted."
msgstr "在机架顶部安装 4 个支柱，间距比控制板安装平台宽度大 1/10\" 至 1/8\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:110
#: 34bb910a51ff4329bad548ae805f511e 377340ab28b2408a81e225de9297e500
#: 6172200b32664774b8cca38807e8b30b 8036f5c24b8e455eba9aa3a075022fc6
#: ca16ae11f46f42f88bc1620a041e31ed
msgid ""
"Insert 1/16\" nylon O-rings through each corner of the autopilot and the "
"standoffs so that the autopilot has no hard connections to the frame. Link "
"`(Here!) <http://www.oringwarehouse.com/>`__"
msgstr ""
"在飞控的每个角和支柱之间穿入 1/16\" 尼龙 O 形圈，使飞控与机架之间没有硬连接。链接 `（此处！） "
"<http://www.oringwarehouse.com/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:114
#: 1f7c524784c24f38baffb855c65bd2cd 4b3cad9827f8414a9ad08e2add851d7f
#: 5eb7f4fe58004a888767c185a668cb06 b8702d6ebba642ad854998282b31d0c9
#: fc1ea3cdfb1e4a04999e61dc24b5027c
msgid ""
"The overall O-ring diameter should be chosen to firmly retain the board "
"while providing for light to moderate initial but rapidly snubbed movement "
"of the board (generally 1/2\" to 3/4\" OD) and Silicone O-rings should "
"generally damp better than Buna-N O-rings (Sizes 15 - 21) if you can acquire"
" them."
msgstr ""
"O 形圈的整体直径应选择能牢固固定板卡，同时提供轻度到中度的初始移动但迅速缓冲（通常外径 1/2\" 至 3/4\"），如果能获得硅胶 O "
"形圈，其减震效果通常优于 Buna-N O 形圈（尺寸 15-21）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:125
#: 0585bce68d354a238d71c39af5c18835 2d3f65c398fd43d6ba2d428362e77637
#: 2f3c4526a07f45a2b13a926275a9f3f6 6c17186931994988af57523108cb34fc
#: c6f9ee926817455d808461d58221ab1e
msgid "FlameWheel F450 O-Ring Suspension Platform Mount"
msgstr "FlameWheel F450 O 形圈悬挂平台安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:127
#: 3299e6435e2649c8994a1a9e2bb7edf5 510d482b6367427b910914e0b651f2ce
#: 9f3e0dad9bf64fffab66cc543fe782f1 cc243d2226f44f2b816588034a82b7f0
#: f90ed2b5999c45eab5cfe5ccf58d0bd8
msgid ""
"Vibrations are short coupled, so all that leaving excess corner clearance "
"does is to require higher initial O-ring tension which reduces vibration "
"damping responsiveness and allows the board to physically tilt more (which "
"is undesirable as it throws the sensor to airframe relationship off)."
msgstr ""
"震动是短耦合的，因此留有过多的角间隙只会要求更高的初始 O "
"形圈张力，这会降低减震响应性，并使板卡物理倾斜更多（这是不希望的，因为会影响传感器与机架的关系）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:133
#: 1c20f98583174b439faa78840a958922 48f9e3ce4f194c68833cd158efcbe92b
#: 754827e0e6344e56a58742b7ab806acc 888de0447ca242d082356c1b910b0e38
#: b59638225a604cdf9cbf1f49e1c9676e
msgid ""
"The disadvantage to O-ring suspension versus Gel pads is that it is "
"mechanically more complex and it requires tuning of both of O-ring diameter "
"and cross section."
msgstr "O 形圈悬挂相比凝胶垫的缺点是机械结构更复杂，需要同时调整 O 形圈直径和截面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:137
#: 002803f5c06349fa8d198a2979f38d43 222f17e551764690955475115204f2ac
#: 57d6816201e1462798f61f8aeee05c87 706308bef0374004bddebd182724febb
#: fe44bf6444984e978236c812542b2950
msgid ""
"You can combine O-ring and gel pad design by using an intermediate plate and"
" benefit from dual rate damping."
msgstr "可以将 O 形圈和凝胶垫设计结合起来，使用中间板以获益于双频减震。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:141
#: 16770d0f7de24e05aa7ee220870f21fe 235a5e4ac5e3411a9f346f96331e50b2
#: d5df8e1853f347ebbe9ea5502fe7f0fc d7fff43808194c1983baaddcfb3733d7
#: e0f350f68af148a5b4884f0866c0bfdb
msgid "Ear Plug Mount"
msgstr "耳塞安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:143
#: 0b081f5918cf4e2cbe1ed2c06e3b1e68 26b89a036fb44c36814d4ff6de4f154e
#: 65ecba0ba6fd4298956176f5c28b4cb4 851751ced2ab47a99d1b0fd8ff6a43b3
#: c87b6e23a96b4c0381adb8d760d2efe9
msgid ""
"Purchase slow response silicon or urethane foam or PVC foam earplugs such as"
" `these from 3M <https://www.3m.com/3M/en_US/company-"
"us/all-3m-products/~/3M-E-A-R-Classic-Earplugs-390-1000-Uncorded-Value-"
"Pack-2000-Pair-Case/?N=5002385+3294755285&rt=rud>`__."
msgstr ""
"购买慢回弹硅胶、聚氨酯泡棉或 PVC 泡棉耳塞，例如 `3M 的这款 <https://www.3m.com/3M/en_US/company-"
"us/all-3m-products/~/3M-E-A-R-Classic-Earplugs-390-1000-Uncorded-Value-"
"Pack-2000-Pair-Case/?N=5002385+3294755285&rt=rud>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:145
#: 0d30ea7c34ac4e249893d0422ff6fd05 91f9cd875d8f4d22bd01b4e1cd28c828
#: a71678df16e548de972201c18b1acb24 e6a9cecec80b4fd68dc19b07c7607c0a
#: f1cc4f0a664444a3b86c174696eefca6
msgid ""
"Create a platform upon which to mount your autopilot with holes at the four "
"corners. The holes should be large enough to allow the ear plugs to be "
"inserted into them but not so loose that the board comes loose during hard "
"landings. Ensure the holes are smooth so they do not cut into the ear plugs."
" Also keep the holes near the corners of your electronic module plate as "
"possible to minimize unnecessary module movement."
msgstr ""
"制作一个安装飞控的平台，在四个角处打孔。孔应足够大以插入耳塞，但不能太松以免板卡在硬着陆时脱落。确保孔边光滑，不会割伤耳塞。孔的位置尽量靠近电子模块板的角，以最大限度减少模块不必要的移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:152
#: 0aabd1c069104779904301e4a6ab06f1 36358e54890b4ce9b9aa6576b529787e
#: 66642149e488426291fc3d26d3661368 8805575382a84c4f8a6b79d9fafa3489
#: a6b824abd4064e8da0887fc5645413d8
msgid ""
"Mount your autopilot on this board with double sided foam tape. Extra mass "
"added to the board may improve vibration damping."
msgstr "用双面泡棉胶带将飞控固定在此板上。在板上增加额外质量可以改善减震效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:154
#: 1f11b911248b4ed8b088548241c303c9 93b8d348f44a44eda12b21158a510b3e
#: a1907e2e7c54485d80f85733656bbfed c49d3efb74544963bbb9373c240ba031
#: e350c0ae67a848c79b1d490a705d356c
msgid ""
"Squeeze the earplugs through existing holes in the frame (or cut new holes) "
"and the holes in the board upon which the autopilot is mounted. \"Tuning\" "
"is possible by varying the amount of earplug left exposed in the middle."
msgstr "将耳塞挤压穿过机架上的现有孔（或新开孔）和飞控安装板上的孔。可通过改变中间暴露的耳塞量来「调整」效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:163
#: 176a69c3593c492d837ceacf14fc76a0 7806f4da1b6a4b9d9c7d8672561b886a
#: c9866c9f556d47c8b91811e2dae31d5b e3ab1fbabc524cf0b89ee44d14d8db41
#: e851add4ca494d07bfdd5ab7938d53da
msgid "Ear Plug Vibration Mount"
msgstr "耳塞减震安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:166
#: 1d64fbc183e9433c9a523b24776d6123 20140a8960c443a89499314f3684dc37
#: 3a6c731363e5480d93a43ec6dc2bc951 4bd8a95f28154aa5bae9d208c9702d3d
#: b326b48ee53c441fb69718c573463941
msgid "Bulb Damper + Ear Plug Vibration Mount"
msgstr "球形减震器 + 耳塞减震安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:168
#: 0c7d4d0b7a194913b9f313b01fb8b81d 5530ddc875c44f0cbe0d89ba00d8e3bd
#: a6bf7d3817644e209e14bb953adfd049 ce748fc87d404da49418efd4df056823
#: ed7c7dddb2c34827b85239c82cf239d8
msgid ""
"Mounting plate with a 100g soft rubber bulb type \"gimbal\" damper at each "
"corner and a half a urethane foam earplug placed inside each one."
msgstr "安装板每个角安装一个 100g 软橡胶球形「云台」减震器，每个减震器内放置半块聚氨酯泡棉耳塞。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:171
#: 79b3c4df77a0499f95c6628b2dc22d5e 7b4447a0eaf24ef6bca9a7f8d13f7772
#: 93b583cc088a41439cb1bf0772162ca3 ad1035b929e844a4845a96738ea45f80
#: ef0ed9852fef49bb96f1c45b25361653
msgid ""
"Gimbal bulb type dampers themselves can work in tension or compression."
msgstr "云台球形减震器本身可以在拉伸或压缩状态下工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:173
#: 62b0d1438cb94d7d901eb214e6172fb3 9e7387f667f7410cbff67ab347e4f039
#: b8b93f42898a43c78e49b7c4117c22b4 df9911c7a8a44b7d97c4008f72607cb6
#: e6b0af720d014fe6b668dab56ab296ac
msgid ""
"The earplugs provide an additional damping medium with a different frequency"
" damping range than the bulb dampers by themselves."
msgstr "耳塞提供额外的减震介质，其频率减震范围与球形减震器本身不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:175
#: 16833e5c2c7b4307a728c8205e959b03 16a4fc7c1055464b880a1ae1e4b44b72
#: 39b026547aa74950b27917d523f76e1a 6f591954b8f34584b0de8e4fd97db9a0
#: e41ca4cb92494a518be3dbc6548d7029
msgid ""
"The ear plugs also stiffen the bulb mounts up a bit preventing excessive "
"free motion being caused by normal flight maneuvers."
msgstr "耳塞还能稍微加固球形安装的刚性，防止正常飞行机动引起的过度自由移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:177
#: 221b579ca07f45538f37631bd4f50012 245c59637f7741d1a7b3976390a5bd77
#: 3ba63849f0f04648a4d503df1b9197a6 518fb65ef77042ebac9b192237883575
#: d68feb8967b44311873c17140f83534d
msgid ""
"This was successful at damping a Flamewheel clone with flexible arms and "
"over size 12\" propellers into the .05 G range."
msgstr "这在具有柔性机臂和超大 12\" 螺旋桨的 Flamewheel 仿制机上成功将震动控制在 0.05G 范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:184
#: 3a68a77f3fbf4580b17bebcc684a7855 50995da4a76146db9b3b1c03de56351d
#: 51b6d764f1314fb69a5f4dd116408955 524ad68d15004c4e88231f2464501245
#: ac65a44a1ab6481380adfaad5fc014b9
msgid ""
"The autopilot is also mounted on anti-vibration grommets available from "
"`McMaster Carr <https://www.mcmaster.com/vibration-damping-grommets>`__ "
"(package of 25 each part #9311K64 recommended)."
msgstr ""
"飞控还可安装在防震垫圈上，可从 `McMaster Carr <https://www.mcmaster.com/vibration-damping-"
"grommets>`__ 购买（推荐每包 25 个，零件号 #9311K64）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:185
#: 610f3f0096a443a490040460ed0363be 70455ef7b87743f9b16e91bf15a9a455
#: 7a073f0985724ec5b5b99b3c7e54d95b a6af04e9bacd455f914b834c956f6c9c
#: a94e7441c4154827b0cd42157d39b6ac
msgid ""
"The 100G bulb type gimbal vibration dampers can be ordered direct from a "
"variety of vendors: \\ `copter-rc.com <http://copter-"
"rc.com/en/accessories/36-100g-av-ball-tension-damper.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"100G 球形云台减震器可直接从多家供应商订购：\\ `copter-rc.com <http://copter-"
"rc.com/en/accessories/36-100g-av-ball-tension-damper.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:189
#: 40b3acca6260486583b790224cba63e8 4a088749c4354047bb64fca199e0d2f9
#: 973f45e115804f61a1a52889b8ea5037 b77956fc7a4347bfb9aa07c291902d78
#: f85962e58efe43aa93dbb4a4e0ee670b
msgid "Advice for reducing vibrations"
msgstr "减少震动的建议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:191
#: 0a4d9b17d2a04b058d96a57c4414d6f8 107bb181843a403cb6e3ab330a9e4dff
#: 31e92223eeb749098462290bf589cdae a6edea1cd0b24951888852e524592948
#: d04887853e174bacb91ebee1823971cd
msgid ""
"For copters the largest source of vibration is normally the blades passing "
"over the arms but other sources of vibration also exist and may be reduced "
"by following this advice:"
msgstr "对于多旋翼，震动的最大来源通常是螺旋桨掠过机臂，但也存在其他震动来源，可通过以下建议加以减少："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:193
#: 1fbb8d7a87754879a2b36975df7ed886 ad49493a15824923b34ad21ee034c04f
#: b30f640ddcf043ea918fb0f26b6729c5 c5973da1fdc24c4db6991c858dd7d07d
#: cfea8c73e55d4cab96775123d80434f7
msgid ""
"Frame flex especially arm flex is a big cause of asynchronous vibration, "
"Frame arms should be as rigid as possible."
msgstr "机架弹性，尤其是机臂弹性，是异步震动的重要原因，机架机臂应尽可能刚性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:196
#: 1a81efecbc5349bdb23e95bf82560093 631f50a449614ac78116b70705c26ca5
#: 9d617e0dca524374b4bb72c5155b124a be65fdcfde4d41549ef802a7d02de987
#: fdc5a188425a416180d0eba8930cff43
msgid ""
"Original DJI Flamewheel copters have sufficiently rigid injection molded "
"arms, the many clones do not"
msgstr "原版 DJI Flamewheel 多旋翼的注塑机臂足够刚性，但许多仿制品则不然"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:197
#: 425ecd10835946dfa0edc1505a3b0908 64e28873da8443efbb84f39681fcf349
#: 9b8aa278859d48289ae70aca6d66ab2e c8265183a52f422fa605baf9c3c73c58
#: ebfb7c33beda40a69ff65e7bab69e5f3
msgid ""
"Aluminum or carbon fibre arms twist and bend less which reduces vibrations"
msgstr "铝合金或碳纤维机臂扭转和弯曲更少，从而减少震动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:198
#: 45b286ec3d834589a9f4b5dc5aab00f3 4e869855faa14f85ac866d0cf2aaa2e8
#: 99422ab7e4304087b6ce430048544d93 d70771314a84454dba36fb4fd617bc0f
#: db20fd018e8c4d07a7e0d4a2f9a15825
msgid ""
"Copters with injection molded exoskeletons or arms like the Iris are "
"sufficiently rigid"
msgstr "Iris 等具有注塑外骨骼或机臂的多旋翼已经足够刚性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:199
#: 01a565256b0146288ffe3b6a07da2d51 32a526a78fc64bac8d5f894aa63d80f6
#: 34424a60b2cc49c985fa01528882ea55 80dd72e1f0754591bb534f012814fd57
#: fdbccdebd8cf4130b428e7b9ffc4b52f
msgid ""
"Cheap, light frames tend to flex more than high quality stronger ones and "
"the heavier you load the copter the more flex it gets (not good)"
msgstr "廉价轻质机架往往比高质量坚固机架弹性更大，飞机载重越大弯曲越多（不良）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:201
#: 1e08b5121a3445d9b5aa909a9c7c913b 95c097604d8b41f3bf686fb0cb59d5c2
#: a21a6a887bf347429524b868370f185a ad312c32a14744be9d22ba678bd9bdaa
#: d7580ba0315844f19758c466e82478b3
msgid ""
"Motor to frame arm and frame arm to central hub mounts need to be secure and"
" flex free (sometimes a problem for carbon tube arms)"
msgstr "电机到机臂以及机臂到中心枢纽的安装需要牢固且无弹性（碳管机臂有时存在问题）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:202
#: 22e2426170184f52bd70ea9ee0861ce1 57ee7babb6244a1ebfa4034c4fdccaa5
#: 7554d62b46cc427da58fc04cd52dcb85 b026c04f6de341e5942e7274a4c9a329
#: df3b0624eb1f41b9956e15cac463e4f9
msgid "Motors need to run smoothly (bearings not worn-out or \"screeching\")"
msgstr "电机需要平稳运转（轴承未磨损或「嘶嘶响」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:203
#: 1a152ca5a14d444b9067b83aaf62ea49 28777b0ce4fd492ea832a58319355151
#: 54324633ee95436aa2cd89b11a77564b 7fb26aeeb9af4e009655085af12585d4
#: c5ab215016064eb5b595a5e81ad0f68b
msgid ""
"Prop adapters connecting the propellers to the motors need to be concentric "
"and very straight"
msgstr "将螺旋桨连接到电机的螺旋桨适配器需要同轴且非常平直"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:204
#: 38821f72c0214d56969772ee97b18560 39a9759811cd49af9e2c95d6f800f2b7
#: 86e1aae773de45d2a34b6f0f1a49c158 d79d1b4c8d8f4f1eb0d397edb40df586
#: f7108d108be24c9391d820cdd46aedfb
msgid "Propellers should be fully balanced using a good manual prop balancer"
msgstr "螺旋桨应使用优质手动螺旋桨平衡仪进行完全平衡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:205
#: 0c338e19447648c58334b7ab09856645 1a8955e35fcb4bb49331cea9973a4ccc
#: 45e50fb11b394399bfa85eb1eccebe1e b4255ee33b7d4d08bdfd6c6fbd5921d0
#: cbd75b42b4e54509ae72738ec2920fec
msgid ""
"Motor balancing (or really well factory balanced motors like T-Motor) can "
"have a major effect"
msgstr "电机平衡（或出厂精良平衡的电机，如 T-Motor）可以产生重大影响"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:206
#: 37c2752ff60b4f03bdf61efadab140ff 74b080a875654a41bfa7fe0692a130d0
#: 7e877b6fb40f4bd9b234c075d5212c62 9145d2a642d940d08ee817828d60cba6
#: d8c32fa1a60c438fa0177045ff1144ba
msgid ""
"Propellers that are not well matched to the frame and weight or do  not have"
" the same flex for CCW and CW are very problematic"
msgstr "与机架和重量不匹配或顺时针/逆时针弹性不同的螺旋桨问题非常突出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:207
#: 0f07226a02cd44d3936954fc3e45f523 3094bc7ea8da40548f57e8c1b66ad364
#: e4e2b3a83b70491db07b415c02d63021 f4afa25ab6f0400b9f6a963f39c5a17f
#: fc934c13a450462b88de08547cd4fc9f
msgid "Good propellers vibrate less"
msgstr "优质螺旋桨震动更少"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:208
#: 16cd4dc555d0439ebedf995451772dce 4d58216e0504473dbb3983d7bb3c7f34
#: adefa1cadf9448d19e5e358c212514bf c2d2129a88764092b45f44686f84d3f6
#: e1ddbe455b174562b121bd5ef60c3b99
msgid ""
"Carbon fiber props are rigid and vibrate less which reduces vibration but "
"are very sharp which is a major safety hazard"
msgstr "碳纤维螺旋桨刚性好、震动少，可减少震动，但非常锋利，存在重大安全隐患"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:211
#: 2069841c467a435cbe87be86933c54fd 91fa287fc2ae4e1f854053d97acfb3ab
#: 9824ea078e4140b89c6910885a849294 e98fd21a0ff2441d875a98f0610509b3
#: feeb937d238f4b0ca8673b9ddc3a5c82
msgid "Summary of the vibrations that should be damped"
msgstr "需要减震的震动总结"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:213
#: 08f96024f99e4bd4b12c3a7dbad84030 0d22c3ff57a14a70998a8e1b265bdf33
#: 16781b9a0a7847dca0b9ec1fca4d78e5 636924efda1e4679a72562ba86ff482b
#: 68f0f03da7244018b85d63f50e918708
msgid ""
"The vibration frequency and amplitude we primarily need to reduce is a "
"characteristic of the motor / prop units turning at flight speed."
msgstr "我们主要需要减少的震动频率和幅度是电机/螺旋桨单元在飞行速度下旋转的特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:215
#: 00a3e561b86f4e568a0a4776da6db7c0 0bd7da50a4a44d1c982d8e848a5ef705
#: 15f167dd5f2543b583d19a4645c0f20d 83ba49194c484d4aaf59cc74c38c4e5e
#: fa3d769d3f464672b3b412dee743f38c
msgid "That is, it is a fairly high frequency with fairly low amplitude."
msgstr "即相当高频率、相当低幅度的震动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:216
#: 3fbf2ec3a13b4f888c841a119cc965f9 8ffa2d7cfe864a7ba3b9bff07048aa40
#: ba10bdcbd2a2439da9c6b2c58bc6560c e3e0d1ac07574ff3bb9edd78f9a45ae5
#: f6da86332e3641de93b913d2ac01a858
msgid ""
"This requires that we provide a short coupled damping and isolation range."
msgstr "这要求我们提供短耦合的减震和隔离范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:217
#: 173883922cca42ffb8cc0b9f0fa68592 621c35657ec0404e92aeb0b51e6062ec
#: b00135c3d0cb48a08aa843975a32e7a7 c805cb1e6bdd41c8ab2f2ce5d5d095a8
#: cc33bc1bc07c49eaa01b83fac62d44e5
msgid ""
"The board itself does not need to have nor benefit from a range of motion "
"that exceeds the amplitude of the vibration."
msgstr "板卡本身不需要也不会从超过震动幅度的运动范围中获益。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:219
#: 0dd1ed8e604a446d828a690568030f5e 291708158449426f8ecc03c089b2fabe
#: 5f419e0d485c4e18834de0ad594f254e f96b79e63a494beea899695402393dc2
#: fcc809a55cad4539a221f3e92816fe32
msgid ""
"Because the board does not apply any force to the airframe, the only thing "
"we need to be concerned with Damping / Isolating is the weight (mass) of the"
" board itself plus the forces applied to it by airframe's normal flight "
"maneuvering."
msgstr "由于板卡不向机架施加任何力，我们需要考虑减震/隔离的唯一因素是板卡本身的重量（质量）加上机架正常飞行机动施加给它的力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:223
#: 526ffcdf8cdf4d409dccfd7f3f331443 94b0c1bee3c149cbb63e93366524a304
#: d71bf3e1c2394e0d9c0bead2760bf329 dbf4c73673444597870389a549ab257b
#: eed1e6f98b8d4a45885f572dc7de8618
msgid ""
"Since excellent broad frequency range, high damping materials are available "
"our biggest concern will be to use the proper amount of them to optimally "
"damp our autopilot (too much is just as bad as too little)."
msgstr "由于可以获得出色的宽频率范围、高减震材料，我们最大的顾虑将是使用适量材料来最优化地减震飞控（过多和过少一样不好）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:227
#: 3762e573c7ab4610bcdae2ed62a83939 c6c04f0e26174c34a0641ebcb51be85c
#: d2f0e0ab3c8d4377a5a183d68a9ef21a e0dd80e3d7a44bc1ba0422da0282822a
#: e764172f664a4d7cb8da6127857f2321
msgid ""
"Combining the autopilot and receiver onto a separate vibration damped "
"electronics module \"plate\" or enclosure can increase the mass of the "
"module making it easier to damp effectively as well as reducing the "
"interconnecting wiring and making the whole system more modular."
msgstr "将飞控和接收机组合到一个独立的减震电子模块「板」或外壳上，可以增加模块的质量，使其更易于有效减震，同时减少连接线路，使整个系统更具模块化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:234
#: 2f8a406a940248f39bac101529c67d68 62e98887b6ae4f7c8a578893e5cf9e1d
#: 7482bcfeced04fb1ace72fa41b653d2e b16a02d4efb24f16915c0863f4d736cf
#: e15aaa19abb94d81b15103467744a8c2
msgid "Additional Vibration Reduction Considerations"
msgstr "附加减震注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:236
#: 1d87668e081140a9b6431c6a244482f6 2e6f578942a74d12a0f59d6f89d76f29
#: 5a0b475eb54f44a2b5175a03437194ec 605d9895276b48a7a4738a4e5552e99b
#: 959ed19eb62743a88e8a9a83ca5a569e
msgid ""
"`Hard Disk Drive Anti-Vibration Grommets "
"<http://www.frozencpu.com/products/8869/scr-138/Hard_Disk_Drive_Anti-"
"Vibration_Screw_Shoulder_Screw_Type.html?tl=g33c113&id=gdASxUFI>`__. can "
"provide sufficient or supplemental vibration reduction"
msgstr ""
"`硬盘减震垫圈 "
"<http://www.frozencpu.com/products/8869/scr-138/Hard_Disk_Drive_Anti-"
"Vibration_Screw_Shoulder_Screw_Type.html?tl=g33c113&id=gdASxUFI>`__ "
"可提供足够或补充的减震"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:238
#: 401694f3019c4551aa897aa39092ece4 6e14afdc3a67401e919398d94f02028a
#: 9cb40db966254dafa201e5e2776127d0 a680a0582eee4f8988b06c605d222ab6
#: eea1a14e79cd447884b6b86787214da3
msgid ""
"Significant gains in vibration isolation can also be realized by using a "
"high flex wire and strain relief approach to all wires connected to the "
"autopilot (and using the minimum number of wires necessary as well)."
msgstr "使用高柔性线缆和应变消除方式连接到飞控的所有导线（以及使用最少必要数量的导线），也可以实现显著的减震隔离增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:242
#: 9e3fa1329f2248f8877a9fa439129005 bfa42dbc3919450cbcbdb03b7bec3b19
#: e8ac8bfa3ab94ab7b98bf47b31ec9bd9 eb498171d1e84ec996ec88b001bdff86
#: fef1eb0ac58d4967b9b536597f645cbb
msgid ""
"Some frames have lower than normal vibration characteristics due to frame "
"stiffness / flex and isolated centralized mass can greatly influence "
"motor/prop vibration transfer to the central fight controller."
msgstr "某些机架由于机架刚性/弹性，具有低于正常水平的震动特性，集中的隔离质量可以大大影响电机/螺旋桨震动向中央飞控的传递。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:246
#: 97cb72dc9b2f4eb9aa0353943f74097f b1af5c6149e94e55a00319aa44831c5b
#: c9aecf4fc1fa49babf23eb3a97df954c da3c96d51f9445b0bbcd46f633003747
#: f52763f567f746ca9d8065c2095682ab
msgid ""
"Isolation and damping can be improved somewhat by sandwiching the autopilot "
"/ enclosure between damping pads on both sides in about twenty percent "
"compression. 30 durometer Sorbothane is actually specified at 15 to 20 "
"percent compression for optimal damping."
msgstr ""
"通过在飞控/外壳两侧夹上约 20% 压缩的减震垫，可以稍微改善隔离和减震。30 硬度 Sorbothane 实际上规定在 15 至 20% "
"压缩下才能实现最佳减震。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:251
#: 10e882e4be4b4cb4a353fef50fc890f6 55e3d9db100149918b2dc6d14dc38546
#: 6dc5b63fcf4b4410b19c34ad88a7ed9b 71ec0dab21c04d2ebb555e07d7b33deb
#: bbcc1911b6a848879397e0205abfa527
msgid ""
"Although 30 durometer Sorbothane seems an excellent candidate, experience "
"indicates that it becomes permanently compressed and is not as effective at "
"vibration reduction as the Gel solutions."
msgstr "虽然 30 硬度 Sorbothane 似乎是极好的候选材料，但实践表明它会永久压缩，减震效果不如凝胶解决方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:254
#: 17dc8e29ce1f4147b1d9a7196e93e7d3 46dda180ef1848718299722a443e190a
#: 7fcf9b77a33641cdb9aad0709e689237 8a7e5745e3504b4c92b62ac7ab35a3b2
#: 9b8adad268d7476486902fdf10d7248f
msgid ""
"A link to a Blog about the first APM anti-vibration mounting system to "
"achieve 0.05 G damping (2/20/2013 improved to 0.02 G), a dual zone isolation"
" system, combining O-ring suspension and silicone pad is `(Here!) "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/very-good-anti-vibration-results-with-"
"following-apm2-5-mount-quad>`__"
msgstr ""
"关于第一个 APM 减震安装系统达到 0.05G 减震（2013 年 2 月 20 日改进至 0.02G）的博客链接，该系统是一种双区隔离系统，结合了 "
"O 形圈悬挂和硅胶垫，参见 `（此处！） <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/very-good-anti-"
"vibration-results-with-following-apm2-5-mount-quad>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:258
#: 2fdadf3e6c3140bcb6fe2cab990133e7 3123f748f63145e38ee48874ce82fcdf
#: b40ecec02aa340e789819ae81135d4bf bfc89a48091a41339bd05429f5d50fd9
#: e9d3c8c142904238970b8bd72772817e
msgid ""
"Motor balancing can also reduce vibration and especially so for cheaper or "
"larger motors. Balancing involves:"
msgstr "电机平衡也可以减少震动，对于较便宜或较大的电机尤其如此。平衡步骤包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:261
#: 5bf4f5f65a9a43c3a6a98d8626e9fec0 6c300a1cd5df4030a5c93609aaf3d7f6
#: 709cc3db80734595a551d5c94091dd0c a034b3c1019b4358a0ff9b47d9c04edf
#: a87622cb702643448652eaad783cec56
msgid ""
"Tightly fasten a small tie wrap around a motor (WITH NO PROP), trim off the "
"extended tab and spin it up."
msgstr "将一根小扎带紧紧绑在电机上（不装螺旋桨），剪去多余部分并启动电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:263
#: 16d01d30a99c42b78d45797f11d7397c 4568e42525734458ba94734025876b74
#: 784879d1e5614f82831720d8449a3f34 8f10a4e109874d998843fb5355b65b99
#: c3ef05d60b584b5e85ee483fbe63f36b
msgid ""
"Try multiple times, each time turning the tie wrap on the motor housing a "
"bit until the vibration reduces or goes away."
msgstr "多次尝试，每次将扎带在电机外壳上转动一点，直到震动减少或消失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:265
#: 30a5aee2e50147abab374e5ce2dd9d8d 55d89da9507c4f31b55485c195a3ed57
#: 7e6b9f0135e54a47a1d5d40f29c2c879 8c50dc853ff14e6fb7dccae71bc115d7
#: a3e33776c725461dafa7c9bac6ce644f
msgid ""
"A small piece of Scotch tape can be re-positioned instead of the tie wrap if"
" desired or for smaller motors."
msgstr "如果需要，可以用一小块透明胶带代替扎带重新定位，小电机也适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:267
#: 04af1b26ff3a46c093482aaa61f1f522 1aba48d1483c40baa97c8508164adc48
#: 75458fdcb81c4da1b15a50f70b6fdb48 d57e6ab114484f1fba8d42e20d196071
#: f6325b55e5ab41b0bba524768bd21d97
msgid ""
"When you locate the spot where there is the least vibration (and you should "
"be able to hear it), mark the spot directly under the clasp of the tie-wrap "
"with a felt pen."
msgstr "当找到震动最小的位置时（应该能听出来），用记号笔在扎带扣正下方的位置做标记。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:270
#: 472c4cd62b2b4c9d922f1ab4360c3d4d 6711bd87860442f8bf9e4e59e80fbb2d
#: 7663e99ba7fa465f8a0c7814e226808b 96b4e9c849c8474a92ffc4ce324518a4
#: d6735cca387e4953bdf7e078e0f41db0
msgid ""
"Add a small dot of hot glue gun glue where the Tie-Wrap clasp was and "
"increase the glue a bit at a time till the vibration is minimized."
msgstr "在扎带扣所在位置点上一小滴热熔胶，逐渐增加直到震动最小化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:273
#: 025641613adf4cd8a1e89b2904190ac1 484b6ab7e06746f5a18c24aba0c02d38
#: 531566e433b64cd79cb3b9800fc07afd 8c4b72a6245b45c091373885f6ba329c
#: e5f17a98cfe9438db25db2d52a613fad
msgid "If you put too much glue on it can be removed with an X-acto knife."
msgstr "如果涂了太多胶水，可以用美工刀去除。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:275
#: 062d410c7bc444a49e591f743ab143f4 44ca7c3ba4ef4f31b3314ac83a362dda
#: 4f9f4254c4ea4d7bbcbfa67ba654f7c4 89f258c626db48a9ade374b2226b15c4
#: a3727a0438c74ac9aa77a02affbb4e9d
msgid ""
"Camera Mounts also need to be effectively isolated and damped from "
"vibration, but they already have a number of \"soft\" mounting solutions."
msgstr "相机支架也需要有效地与震动隔离和减震，但它们已经有多种「软」安装解决方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:278
#: 73cbb7d03ca242b3a5dad3331f872fed 928e8042db274b8abda9d9da9bec2ed2
#: ac6e459d9ab142edae09b2623fb39c5d b16e9fa31e194fc5b40483b70a1172f7
#: d169c51ebda24e2e88d92a8a8d19267f
msgid ""
"The camera servos need to be vibration isolated as well, either in the "
"isolated camera mount itself or with their own vibration reduction solution."
msgstr "相机舵机也需要减震隔离，可以在隔离的相机支架内或使用其自己的减震解决方案实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:281
#: 1ca26146920044ac9b949908404801b0 5376c0471710421b9c080be6c2557949
#: 8fc78dd4d3a3490690d57a96917e5ec6 c8e45a399ba540e19835a8534533aa1b
#: df67626cedcf4258a1b69504cebf42fa
msgid ""
"You should use high quality ball joints on your camera servo arms and "
"adequate bearings or bushings in the mount itself with zero free play to "
"prevent inertial slop."
msgstr "应在相机舵机臂上使用高质量球形接头，并在支架本身安装适当的轴承或衬套，间隙为零，以防止惯性松动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:284
#: 4037976bfb78403f874baa1c844619f9 9eb5b53bf56d4ac1a96cba9a4dfceb44
#: d0e5137437be4f0ca33045c6b5395084 dff66cb5cca84a26a9f455fbfb510257
#: f0deaa20dc464cee9e6c109ee6e4d87c
msgid ""
"Quality servos without free play are also a must for precision camera work."
msgstr "精密相机工作还必须使用无间隙的高质量舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:286
#: 33b7c3151bf746f69933c2ff42cdfcd5 49597aecb5d9418d8b9b4eb7af224824
#: 78935682b63f41dab2dec5f486fe3327 7ac3f148241c4ae6a478649ea898c224
#: d8fec75f453e441c89cef676701100ec
msgid ""
"At this point in time it seems that the more rigid the frame the better "
"because frame flex introduces undesirable mechanical delay (hysteresis) in "
"translating motor induced actions to the centrally located autopilot. (Do "
"NOT shock mount the motor Arms)."
msgstr "目前看来，机架越刚性越好，因为机架弹性会在将电机产生的动作传递到中央飞控时引入不期望的机械延迟（迟滞）。（切勿对电机机臂进行减震安装）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:290
#: 04379bd94b1c4756acb5356c16f9f5a4 11cdbe5ee5a34ad28267d57834c40214
#: 6a12ab2193874e1e84097a293936dd24 cd708817871e48b0a788db04899d5080
#: de750639b7bc43c4ba8b62f2e41e5db6
msgid ""
"The amount and type of damping medium needs to be carefully matched to the "
"weight (mass) of the item we are trying to isolate as well as the frequency "
"and amplitude of the vibrations we are seeking to damp. We are trying to "
"isolate an autopilot that weighs less than 2 ounces and this is a very small"
" mass."
msgstr ""
"减震介质的数量和类型需要与我们试图隔离的物体重量（质量）以及我们试图减震的震动频率和幅度仔细匹配。我们试图隔离的飞控重量不到 2 "
"盎司，这是一个非常小的质量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:295
#: 270a135e0732418abaa47d8de347ecc7 6736cda925344abfbf8e089b168b8c3f
#: 940cb85fc74e42149f7e538c265a9aee bc1e95fd337a4a1e843a1873713650c3
#: c95e8509654a4fd484ba375262dee0e5
msgid ""
"Virtually all off the shelf solutions (either pad or stud type) are designed"
" for an isolated mass that would weigh at least 5 to 10 times what an "
"average autopilot weighs for optimal effectiveness. This includes all pre-"
"made Sorbothane, Alpha gel, EAR, memory foam or other silicone or urethane "
"gel or foam mounts as well as Lord Micro mounts."
msgstr ""
"几乎所有现成的解决方案（无论是垫片型还是螺柱型）都是为隔离质量至少为普通飞控重量 5 至 10 倍的物体设计的，以达到最佳效果。这包括所有预制的 "
"Sorbothane、Alpha 凝胶、EAR、记忆泡棉或其他硅胶或聚氨酯凝胶或泡棉支架，以及 Lord Micro 支架。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:301
#: 164eabd6492a4d5ca7cfa1357650014a 7d53f5e48fe04cab86721f8e3037fdb2
#: 9df772229ba64c19b7972bf6dacf88d0 dc08881def7740cea69ed727bf5a4920
#: f3da7af56d854f06b989cd6a9e0cd9d3
msgid ""
"A threaded stud or sleeve type mount gel mount properly designed for the "
"mass of our autopilot or electronics module undergoing the stress's of "
"normal flight would be a much better long term solution."
msgstr "专为我们飞控或电子模块质量设计的螺纹螺柱或套管型凝胶支架，能够承受正常飞行的应力，将是更好的长期解决方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:307
#: 005dfc1d167f472c96f7890415a1c1b5 019f7dc1edec4c2f980b01eb14c3df5b
#: 044d416374a54caab957c6950ee1fc93 7c8a150b7c504b6f8f2e97b8007afcaa
#: 8475afa6c74444bb88e1217c086f288b
msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "术语"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:309
#: 182789a76ab3412ca51835a3a6e361ce 2e9cdfdb73a0482aa3c2ce5213d75d08
#: c1d8a987144e4d9995da9bc25ed04b9b dac88ff3cffd4924826c6103342e0e99
#: ec740905ad404d16bf1d6906d81b7e5a
msgid ""
"The methods used will typically incorporate both damping and isolation:"
msgstr "所使用的方法通常包含减震和隔离两种："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:311
#: 03b326313af44b76be94a9a2e2b854ee 16292c253dbb49e5af4e6df0f3383ac3
#: 41db56da5d9a4ec58cac2c9421819542 7d478d6d1d2d4e4996c2dcab5d99ae28
#: b8bfbdd5755c491fa1965d0a89c2f253
msgid ""
"*Isolation* is simple undamped (spring or rubber band support) which allows "
"the movement of the isolated object largely separate from the containing "
"object (Automobile spring for instance)."
msgstr "*隔离* 是简单的无阻尼（弹簧或橡皮筋支撑），允许被隔离物体的运动基本上与包含物体分离（例如汽车弹簧）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:314
#: 00711ded6f15488bbe829852e0c2bb86 10aa57cb2353407a9fbe070bab637fee
#: 8fdf6a0e90ae486fbf349ae582f9e595 c69b4d40f7f94b57bdeee2006708f5b6
#: f439632601014d78b8718e9f4758830b
msgid ""
"*Damping* is the conversion of vibration into heat energy by a shock "
"absorbing medium (automobile shock absorber for instance)."
